<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n49907" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰδῐωτ-εύω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>occupy a private station</i>, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δημοσιεύω</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ap.</u>
				32a
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>R.</u>
				579c
			</span></i>; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄρχω</span>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Hier.</u>
				8.5
			</span></i>; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τυραννεύω</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Isoc.
				2.4
			</span></i>; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολιτεύεσθαι</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Aeschin.
				1.195
			</span></i>; of a country, <i>to be of no consideration</i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				8.7.7
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>practise privately</i>, of a physician, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ δημοσιεύων</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Plt.</u>
				259a
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Grg.</u>
				514e
			</span></i>sq. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> c. gen.
			rei, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς ἀρετῆς ἰ</span>. <i>to be
				unpractised, unskilled in . . </i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Prt.</u>
				327a
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b> in Lit.
			Crit., <i>to be vulgar</i>, of expressions, <i><span class="en">
				Longin.
				31.2
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
